  "private": true,
  "description": "PRIVATE source package of @klarlabs-studio/glossa (RFC 0002 Amendment 1): not published; its build output ships as a subpath of the umbrella. Glossa's MessageFormat kernel for tooling: MF2 and ICU MF1 into the canonical MF2 data model, stringify, format and validation.",
